# The pass that names the optional mods: a body retexture drawn without legs, and something that
# fills wornGraphicPath. Select it with `Run-PickleWsl.ps1 -DepMap wsl-deps.wdi-ab.map`.
# One line per mod: packageId then its Workshop id.
#
# Both carry the captures rather than decorate them. Without a body retexture drawn without legs
# there is no defect to photograph; with nothing filling wornGraphicPath the pawn renders bare,
# because vanilla Apparel_Pants has no worn graphic of its own.
#
# astryl.tailormade is not here: it is a hard dependency of the mod itself, so it is staged in
# every pass and listing it again only made the staging announce it twice.
wdi.realistic.bodies   3527486510
ab.vplrf               2986402536
